// The app's icon (packaging/windows/bigmoeonedge.ico, from packaging/windows/make-icon.py), under the
// two ids it is asked for by: 1, the first group, which Explorer, the taskbar, shortcuts and the
// notification area take (os_windows.cpp loads it by that id), and IDI_APPLICATION (32512), which
// the webview library loads from the executable for its window's class icon.
1 ICON "@BMOE_DESKTOP_ICON@"
32512 ICON "@BMOE_DESKTOP_ICON@"
